  "study": "FormalCRRC Qwen2.5 Same-Family Model-Scale Ablation",
  "title": "Primary endpoint, case status, revision checksum, provenance",
  "what_changed": "Declared nontrivial TRR the primary scaling endpoint and TCE, FSRR, E*, accuracy and MVR supporting endpoints. Declared Cases A-D non-exclusive descriptive flags and defined Delta_7_to_14 = TRR_14B - TRR_7B and Delta_14_to_32 = TRR_32B - TRR_14B, which the analysis now reports with those signs. The pre-flight writes model_revisions.sha256 and the runner verifies it before loading. The analysis hashes the pre-flight, results-writer and amendment scripts into run_manifest.json. The runner, analysis and verifier read the pinned code manifest from the latest checksummed amendment. checksums.sha256 now also covers preserved infrastructure logs. No metric definition, population, contrast, test, bootstrap setting, case condition, threshold or protocol element changed."
